&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EEhadHZauoQt9Zx9xXZlbCWLgve&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLOSdW8ftoVXW9x0GURlldIrgDg&quot;&gt;OKX’s Legal team provides legal advice and guidance to the company across all coverage areas and geographic locations, and supports business growth and development by working with all teams within the company to help them achieve their goals. We are a high-functioning, collaborative and fast-paced group of lawyers who enjoy the cutting-edge nature of our work and our industry.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLOSdW8ftoVXW9x0GURlldIrgDg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLOSdW8ftoVXW9x0GURlldIrgDg&quot;&gt;Our Americas Legal team is the primary legal partner to OKX&#39;s regulated businesses across the Americas region, advising on a broad range of topics including regulatory strategy, regulatory licensing, product launches, strategic partnerships and corporate matters. The Americas Legal team works cross-functionally with leaders across the company to help build and scale an innovative and compliant OKX platform.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HLS4dCnWbo8Av5xU3USlEgkMgKY&quot;&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVDpdEi1SobDapxdEUelQFywg0g&quot;&gt;This is an essential, high-profile role at one of the fastest-growing global cryptocurrency exchanges based in San Jose, CA. The Deputy General Counsel will play a central role in proactively shaping OKX&#39;s regulatory and legal strategy in the US and across the Americas. The Deputy General Counsel will act as a key partner and provide day-to-day counsel to senior business leadership of OKX&#39;s US business, including the coordination of efforts with Compliance, Risk, Operations, Finance and other functions. The Deputy General Counsel will stay abreast of all regulatory changes applicable to the digital asset space in the US, promptly communicate developments to OKX&#39;s senior business leadership, and help guide the business in identifying growth opportunities in the US. The position will coordinate the efforts of the legal function serving OKX&#39;s business in the US as well as the Americas more broadly, and will report to OKX&#39;s VP, Legal.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVDpdEi1SobDapxdEUelQFywg0g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVDpdEi1SobDapxdEUelQFywg0g&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of law, regulations, and product innovation - driving complex licensing initiatives, advising senior stakeholders on questions without clear precedent, and helping the business move quickly through an evolving regulatory landscape. We are looking for a hands-on legal leader with sharp judgment, strong interpersonal skills, and the desire to work with a top-notch legal team. The right candidate is not afraid to jump into novel and complex matters, and is willing to roll up their sleeves and work effectively under time pressure. We offer a competitive base salary and bonus structure as well as excellent benefits and an opportunity to work in a cutting-edge industry that will be the future of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WLfedzFw4oIlISx10hPln8HtgVd&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z27QdbXyKo3eoaxavWIlbPI9gbf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop and advance a best-in-class regulatory strategy in the US and across the Americas, including the development and maintenance of strong relationships with regulators.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XH4udkcI6oHvJjxFGIPlZCtsg3f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Engage directly with regulators and business counterparties as a key point of contact for OKX, as well as interacting on a daily basis with senior executives at OKX.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXFDdfSmaoSFMOxMuKUlChNXgr5&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify growth opportunities and strategic initiatives based on proactive, timely, actionable analysis of US regulatory developments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DEC4d2EaRoiNsCxYSFrl6qiIg9d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead and manage attorneys covering various Americas regions so that legal efforts are coordinated and consistently achieve successful outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FddcdRWTOoYtwnxdUxKlbLRygje&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage a wide range of legal requests and advise on legal risk with an eye toward achieving the strategic goals of the company&#39;s regional business leaders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HmsPdyGA9oC6zhxbRa0lYtIvgWf&quot;&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XcczdU4wQowJzNxLvijlV2MXgpc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong communication and leadership skills, and excellent judgment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GKqOd9VaRoAPy0xNMX1lYdREgC0&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Self-starter who can contribute as both an individual and a team member, with limited reliance upon external counsel.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NMr7dIjfuoximpxb6v3lTfaUgMc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Membership with a US state bar or equivalent.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L0fZdDLaUoWf5fxzkublvw07gmb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;12+ years of regulatory experience dealing with financial services laws and regulations in a highly-regulated environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JoUCdEJoFoBTkNx08y4lFEKjgCg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior experience can be in-house at a regulated financial firm or in the crypto industry (preferable), at a top-tier law firm, and/or at a regulator.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MOCfdiOqio1FyZxlmpQl8lnyg9b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience driving projects to completion on expedited timelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A9SAdJyMAo2NxKxEdOJltP3rgK3&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Must be highly-driven, proactive, responsive and precise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RnWfdFTlOoaT4oxD8DWlFb0MgRe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience making strategic recommendations to senior management and senior legal team members.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ImfWdXG3uoLGlsxbgqelmlOFgff&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable navigating legal ambiguity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VQ9WdDFSpoUgdKxKwgblzu9Xg7f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience advising on cross-jurisdictional legal and regulatory matters.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OpRUdOra6oO6IWxlJ2Vl6vy8gef&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
