&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ScDYdPdysoFWPjx4THTlgeRqgVb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlghpSui1bhSdJhlCY7sTNs2f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead global finance operations. Accounting and reporting, month end close, financial controls, regulatory reporting, local audit, and regulatory reporting all sit under you. You&#39;ll lead a team of 30+ professionals across 15 countries and be accountable for the quality, timeliness, and defensibility of everything that comes out of it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1rvbs2hiNNnNoSTLtDVmrf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with the regional C-suite on what&#39;s next. Business strategy, exchange listings, infrastructure investment, and M&amp;amp;A — you&#39;ll be in the room, and you&#39;ll be the one putting numbers behind the options. Capital planning and investor relations sit with you, as do external partnerships that carry a financial dimension.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgtou6F8gyu854ClITho40Fe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Price the decisions before they&#39;re made. New products, new markets, new licenses. Each one gets a financial evaluation from your team — unit economics, capital requirements, tax and regulatory cost, downside cases. Leadership should be able to trust that analysis without re-running it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgBTTRYzBhGbLalbs4jd8HM1&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Tighten controls and risk frameworks across crypto and fiat. This is the part most finance leaders haven&#39;t done before. Internal controls, SOX readiness, audit, and global regulatory obligations have to work across digital-asset custody and movement as well as conventional banking flows. You&#39;ll build the frameworks that hold up in both worlds.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgGndOLJTXg56PtZVQ3356mg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own external relationships. Regulators, banking partners, payment providers. These relationships determine what the business can and can&#39;t do in a given market, and they need a senior finance voice who regulators and bank credit committees take seriously.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgSxaOcbhhycAx4yYchzpiVe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Standardize the plumbing. Global finance policies, a single reporting architecture, consistent close and consolidation processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg9EKyDPNUE1cMRVlDhVQqwh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Sit on leadership committees at both the global and local entity level, including boards and governance bodies where a licensed entity requires it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiXmJ1mfRRq0zNehVGrPNOb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of regional financial regulations and cryptocurrency market developments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
