&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxR4dsD0CoPBKAxzna4lQHOIgHd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define the growth product vision and own the roadmap and set the strategic direction for where we invest, what we build, and how we win across key markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CmqvdAWN1oWCRUxiaD1li7shgRh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design, ship, and iterate on growth campaigns and features with clear hypotheses, rapid experimentation cycles, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BCy9d9KUIo3JsLxHtkOlBqiQgif&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Read data like a native: independently conduct funnel analysis, cohort segmentation, and channel ROI modeling to identify the highest-leverage growth opportunities and make fast resource allocation decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdtYdDdWNoGsLrxEYB1lApsZgve&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build fraud-resistant growth systems by design — model abuse vectors proactively, architect product-level guardrails against bot attacks, multi-accounting, and reward farming, and balance acquisition scale with cost quality as a P&amp;amp;L owner.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Txp2diMBKovm43xCTQylRTgKgBc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional execution cross-functionally in a fast-moving, globally distributed org.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XyyTdzfsPoEBSXx2D0ClfhWug0c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
