&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBpVddjIDodqjNxdNn0lKIyYg3E&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with regional and global stakeholders to localize growth strategies and adapt playbooks across different regulatory and market environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
