&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgmxJimB2ghqvfsX4qWdyAzw&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build deep business acumen to diagnose needs and co-create solutions with leaders, acting as a strategic conduit between the business and HR team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg6Qi7lIYYSZS0yZ3eAkYiGh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent &amp;amp; Leadership Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
