&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Rii1dTIlEoczkLxtDQXlUnUfgKf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LiGhdxeR5o90dWxQx0PlvXhWgef&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our Payments Team, based in the US.&amp;nbsp;Payments is where OKX meets the real financial world. Our team has built and operates the infrastructure connecting OKX to dozens of payment channels across global markets, giving users deposit and withdrawal options that are fast, convenient, and — most importantly — trustworthy. That platform moves and safeguards user assets at institutional scale, continuously, across time zones and regulatory environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EygGdnKpfoVfANxOueslvEINgLg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkjhdUidkogyfNxr8SxlfsmfgKd&quot;&gt;This is not a greenfield team looking for its footing. The team is established, the platform is in production at scale, and we are actively expanding — both in scope and in headcount. That combination is rare: you get the leverage of joining a growing team where your work visibly shifts the roadmap, along with the discipline that comes from a system already trusted with real money.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YnK9daJy2oG9LKxCkxyltv2OgVe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ICledhhh8oqOIQxwu6MlFUpOgId&quot;&gt;It&#39;s also an unusually good place to learn. Payments is a domain that&#39;s hard to pick up from the outside — every market has its own rails, its own settlement behavior, its own failure modes, its own compliance expectations. Here you&#39;ll work across a wide range of payment methods and channels, and you&#39;ll build the judgment that comes from operating financial systems where the stakes are real: how to design for correctness when money is on the line, how to reconcile, how to recover, how to keep a platform observable enough that you find problems before your users do.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RDEFdzI6AoFDCCxCM0OlHzuCgzg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSgidYN3UojGLAxmVAwlojikghh&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with product managers, designers, and partner-facing teams, and you&#39;ll set the technical bar for the engineers around you — through design docs, code reviews, and the everyday habit of doing things properly when nobody&#39;s watching.&lt;/div&gt;
