&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusEkG4iEGy0aGeaKO1nwez6c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Serve as technical SME by sharing new data mining techniques, maintaining technical reference documentation, and interfacing with partner technology teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusAa0YeiGQGsQcVxKYcVfflb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
