&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuscWMekQ6U2yWOovNaVTK7zg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide technical guidance for engineering projects that incorporate new data points into the investigation team’s toolkit, such as API integrations or internal data transformations.&lt;/div&gt;
